title: Hunger real-path — starving across the bands, then death
story: hunger-demo
description: |
  ADR-263 / ADR-262 #7 — the forcing function. A `use hunger` meter runs on the
  banded-scalar crossing engine through the real bundle, proving the engine is
  scalar-agnostic (not score-shaped): severity grows on a clock (grows 3/turn),
  crosses each band (author `says` phrases, then the platform fallback for a
  rung with none), and reaching `fatal` kills the player.
---

